    lineId: cs02_00
    text: Computer. Subject has escaped containment. Request advice.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 6
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: COMPUTER
    lineId: cs02_01
    text: With a firm tone of voice, demand the subject lie down on the ground, hands
      behind their back.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.325
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: SCIENTIST
    lineId: cs02_02
    text: "Ma'am? Lie down on the ground, please, hands behind your\u2014 behind
      your back."
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.4650002
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: SCIENTIST
    lineId: cs02_03
    text: Subject did not comply.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 6
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: COMPUTER
    lineId: cs02_04
    text: 'Approach the subject and repeat the ultimatum in an even firmer tone of
      voice. Add at the end: "or else".'
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
